## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## Nordic SIRI Profile — Baseline (positive membership allowlist)
## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## ROLE: The positive layer of the profile — which SIRI classes and
##       fields are *in* the Nordic SIRI Profile, with cardinality,
##       governing scope and provenance. Complements siri-nordic.ttl,
##       whose rules encode where the profile *tightens* the base.
##
## Seeded once from the curated service catalogue and element
## specifications in siri-nordic-model.ttl (in turn projected from the
## Nordic SIRI Profile documentation Table_*.md files). Every field is
## nordic:Baseline (established profile content, no decision ID). From
## here the profile inherits from CCB decisions — a change flips a
## field's provenance from nordic:Baseline to nordic:decision
## "SIRI-xxxx". This file is not regenerated from documentation; the
## seed is a one-time bootstrap aid.
##
## Scope legend:
##   profile:NordicSIRI     — in the common Nordic SIRI Profile (ET, SX, VM)
##   profile:EnturExtension — documented but outside NSP v1.1 scope (FM)
##
## CLASS BINDING (applied): nordic:onClass / nordic:inProfile point at the
## real generated base IRI — the global element class where SIRI declares
## one (siri:EstimatedVehicleJourney), else the XSD complexType
## (siri:MonitoredVehicleJourneyStructure). The wire element name a message
## actually uses is kept in nordic:element (and in each nordic:path). This
## bridges the message-element view to the type-based base and mints nothing
## in the CEN-owned siri: namespace. The same binding is applied across
## siri-nordic-model.ttl; siri-nordic.ttl references elements as strings only.
##
## Imports: siri-nordic-vocab.ttl (nordic:, profile:)
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

@prefix siri:    <https://siri-cen.eu/ontology#> .
@prefix nordic:  <https://siri-cen.eu/nordic#> .
@prefix profile: <https://siri-cen.eu/profile#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<https://siri-cen.eu/profile/nordic-siri-baseline> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Nordic SIRI Profile — Baseline" ;
    rdfs:comment "Positive membership allowlist for the Nordic SIRI Profile, seeded from siri-nordic-model.ttl. Base snapshot: SIRI v2.2 (generator v2.2-6-g7b1463b)." ;
    owl:imports <https://siri-cen.eu/nordic> .

## =================================================================
## SHARED CONTAINERS
## =================================================================

## --- ServiceDelivery (NordicSIRI) ---
siri:ServiceDelivery nordic:inProfile profile:NordicSIRI ;
    nordic:provenance nordic:Baseline .

[] a nordic:ProfileMember ;
    nordic:onClass siri:ServiceDelivery ;
    nordic:element "ResponseTimestamp" ;
    nordic:path "ServiceDelivery/ResponseTimestamp" ;
    nordic:cardinality "1..1" ;
    nordic:provenance nordic:Baseline .
[] a nordic:ProfileMember ;
    nordic:onClass siri:ServiceDelivery ;
    nordic:element "ProducerRef" ;
    nordic:path "ServiceDelivery/ProducerRef" ;
    nordic:cardinality "1..1" ;
    nordic:provenance nordic:Baseline .

